@everyone 

There are some transactions from Tier 2 still being pushed through so we are going to delay Tier 3 until those are finished. We will announce with an update shortly!

Again, please remember this is a TEST mint. The issues we see on these tests ensure a much smoother experience for future mints!

@everyone 

Tier 1 in 10 minutes! 

@OG | Old Guard @Cheeky Racer Holder Roles only

@everyone

For anyone that is worried about not minting in Tier 2, please don't fret. We structured Tier 2 in a way that will battle against users gaming our mint system (by requiring ownership of BubbleJett and Javelin NFT's OR Bubblejett OG Custom).  This allows a majority of vehicle holders to mint an NFT in Tier 2.  In fact, Tier 2 will likely NOT sellout because of this structure. The remaining supply will spill over to the public where the rest of the community can participate in getting a Cheeky Racer Suit! (edited)
Tuesday, December 20, 2022 at 11:26 AM

@everyone 

If you have "payment gateway initiated" in your payment status, your order is still being submitted to the blockchain. Please note that you will not be able to mint during Tier 4 if your payment status is still in this state. 

Have no fear, you will be able to retry payment for your NFT from Tier 3 if necessary and will receive your NFT after a successful payment.
